{"level":30,"time":1778246225757,"pid":122,"hostname":"bd047d16-36d","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3VQYT8GEEJ8AZ6W8RMMHCP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I've read the grouping file. This is a comprehensive grouping on \"Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines\". Let me understand what I need to do:\n\n1. **Grouping Context**: The grouping covers clearances between overhead electric facilities (poles, conductors, guy wires) and proposed site features - buildings, fences, retaining walls, driveways, parking areas, sidewalks, lighting, utilities, and other improvements.\n\n2. **Regulatory Overview**: Key requirements include:\n   - 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground clearance from all overhead conductors\n   - 15-foot radial clearance from distribution primary/neutral conductors\n   - 16-18 feet vertical clearance for driveways/parking depending on truck traffic\n   - Tree placement within specific distances\n   - 48-hour notification requirement\n\n3. **Documents to Review**: Site plan sheets, building elevation sheets, section/profile exhibits, survey data, landscape plans, utility plans, and cover sheet notes.\n\n4. **Checklist Items**: There are 47 items (EL-1.1 through EL-1.47) that I need to evaluate.\n\nNow I need to:\n- Read the project README to find the documentId\n- Read facts.md to understand the site characteristics\n- Explore the site plan sheets to gather evidence\n- Evaluate each checklist item\n- Return findings for only fail and not-verifiable items\n\nLet me start by reading the project README and facts.md.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e942253-7258-4c80-b1f5-d3905a77aa10","uuid":"1597beae-cdb5-4325-b00d-c4e7121b2092"}
