** Project and sheet administrative data. READ for project name (Valley View Townhomes), owner (WM 41 Austin RE, LLC), location (3759 Valley View Road), engineering firm (Blu Fish Collaborative), landscape architect seal, and sheet number (32 of 35).\n\n---\n\n- `block-1.md` — notes: Notes on remedial tree care, aeration, and supplemental nutrient requirements.\n- `block-2.md` — notes: Notes related to site development permit irrigation.\n- `block-3.md` — notes: Notes on modified and natural area protection.\n- `block-7.md` — notes: Notes related to site development permit landscape.\n\nAll other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n","numLines":51,"startLine":1,"totalLines":51}}}
