n*   **Roadway/Driveway:** The pad near Building 1 is situated directly next to the curved concrete curb of the entrance drive.\n*   **Fire Hydrant:** There is a fire hydrant, denoted by a small circle labeled **\"FH\"**, located just south of the transformer pad situated between Building 7 and Building 6.\n*   **Retaining Walls:** The pad east of Building 4 is located near a line labeled **\"Existing Stone Retaining Wall\"**."}]}
