W\") lines are routed in the east-west gap between Buildings 7 and 6, running roughly parallel to the underground electric line serving that pad.\n*   **Separations/Conflicts**: There are no explicit profile views, separation dimensions, or conflict callouts labeled on this plan view indicating how crossings are handled vertically. A \"Utility Notes\" block states: \"Contractor shall verify horizontal and vertical location of existing utilities prior to construction.\"\n\n**7. Easements, Property Boundaries, or Site Constraints**\n*   **Transformer Pad 1** (NW) is located near the western property boundary, which has a labeled \"Sidewalk Easement\" further south, but no specific electrical or transformer easement is drawn around the pad itself. Large circular tree protection zones are shown to the north and west of this pad, but the pad appears to sit outside their drawn radii.\n*   **Transformer Pads 2, 3, and 4** are located internally within the site, in the narrow common areas between townhome buildings. No specific dedicated easements (e.g., P.U.E. or transformer easements) are delineated with boundary lines around these specific internal pads.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3