{"level":30,"time":1778246298283,"pid":122,"hostname":"bd047d16-36d","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":10,"prompt":"Examine Sheet 10 (Fire Protection Plan) for:\n\n1. Fire lanes - Are there fire lanes designated on the plan? Where are they located relative to the four transformer pads? If fire lanes are shown, what is the clearance from the transformer pads to the fire lanes?\n\n2. Fire hydrant location - Where is the private fire hydrant located? What is its distance from the transformer pads?\n\n3. Fire escapes - Are there any external stairs, fire escapes, or stairwells shown on the buildings? If so, where are they and what distances do they have from the transformer pads?\n\n4. Building access points - Are fire access routes or emergency exits indicated that would relate to transformer pad locations?\n\nPlease use compass directions and building references to describe locations.","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (10)"}
{"level":30,"time":1778246300085,"pid":122,"hostname":"bd047d16-36d","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3VT7Y4GKAP65SVNX0KHZY7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have a clearer picture:\n\n**Key findings from the electrical design plan (Sheet 21):**\n- The proposed electrical infrastructure WITHIN the site is all UNDERGROUND\n- There IS an EXISTING overhead electric line (OHE) on the WESTERN edge of the property, outside the main property boundary, located in a right-of-way or easement\n- This OHE line voltage is not specified\n- No pad-mounted equipment shown on the site - only underground infrastructure\n\n**Key findings from landscape plan (Sheet 31):**\n- Trees are proposed throughout the site, including along boundaries\n- Trees are shown near/under the overhead electric (OHE) line on the southern boundary according to the vision analysis\n\nWait, there's a discrepancy here. The landscape plan vision said trees are near OHE on the SOUTHERN boundary, but the electrical plan vision said the OHE is on the WESTERN boundary. Let me re-read these more carefully.\n\nActually, looking at the landscape plan vision again: \"A line labeled with the text '- OHE -' runs horizontally along the entire southern (bottom) boundary of the site plan area shown.\" \n\nAnd for the electrical plan: \"Along the far left (western) edge of the drawing, outside the main property boundary line, there is a dashed line that is repeatedly labeled 'OHE'\"\n\nThese could be the same line if the property boundary is oriented diagonally or if there's confusion about orientation. Let me check the Site Plan (Sheet 9) to get a better understanding of the overall layout and utilities.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id"