se plans has been based upon record information only and may not match locations as constructed. The contractor shall contact Texas 811 for assistance in determining existing utility locations prior to beginning construction. Contractor shall field verify locations of utility crossings prior to beginning construction.\"*\n\n**4. Cross-reference regarding the southern property boundary and Valley View Road**\nBased on the North arrow situated in the top right corner of the drawing (pointing upwards):\n*   **Valley View Road is located on the Western boundary** of the site, not the Southern boundary. As noted in point 1, there *is* an overhead electric line running along this Western boundary adjacent to Valley View Road.\n*   Looking at the **Southern boundary** (the bottom edge of the drawing), there are **no overhead electric lines (\"OHE\") visible**. The southern boundary shows adjoining property information (e.g., \"William Lewis...\").\n\n**5. Reference to landscape plan or tree coordination**\n*   In the bottom center of the sheet, there is a bordered box titled **\"Tree List\"**. The text inside this box states exactly:\n    **\"Refer to landscape plan sheet 32 for the tree list.\"**\n*   Additionally, large, light-grey circular linework representing existing tree canopies is drawn throughout the site plan, demonstrating visual coordination between the electrical routing and existing trees, though the specific tree data is deferred to the landscape plan.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1402,"outputTokens":762,"totalTokens":4049,"reasoningTokens":1885},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"