mary roof structures, but they do come relatively close to the building corners in the top-right and bottom-left areas of the site plan.\n*   **Guy Wire**: The identified \"DOWN GUY\" on the top boundary extends from a pole located inside the property outwards toward the property line.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1394,"outputTokens":935,"totalTokens":7361,"reasoningTokens":5032},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":1778246291114,"endTime":1778246341333,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"k-L9aYKOGaOXqOYPw-zywAw"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.074617","marketCost":"0.074617","inferenceCost":"0.074392","inputInferenceCost":"0.002788","outputInferenceCost":"0.071604","reportingTagWriteCost":"0.000225","generationId":"gen_01KR3VT3MGW0ZXWN24D15CXZMH"}}},"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided existing conditions survey, here is a description of the electric infrastructure depicted. References to positions (top, bottom, left, right) correspond to the image e