bject property (Lot 1, Mecey Subdivision). READ to confirm property identity.\n*   **Block 1**: Graphic scale bar. READ to confirm the 1\" = 20' measurement baseline.\n*   **Blocks 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14**: Boilerplate & Administrative information, including the Texas 811 call warning, engineer's seal (Jason K. Rodgers), project metadata (Sheet 11 of 39, Project No. RJ3 70496), title block, and standard utility and design disclaimers. READ for project details or administrative tracking; otherwise, these can be skipped during a technical review.\n\n---\n\nAll other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n","numLines":38,"startLine":1,"totalLines":38}}}
