{"level":30,"time":1778246492525,"pid":122,"hostname":"bd047d16-36d","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3VXNXCK527P7X7HH70FZC1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mfv4L787u1HcBR2nv1n7aH","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"13","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.1","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Five transformer pads are shown on the Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) adjacent to buildings (west of Bldgs 1, 2, 8 and east of Bldgs 4, 7). No clearance dimensions are dimensioned on the plan between any transformer pad and building edges.","reasoning":"While the pads are clearly shown in proximity to buildings, the exact distance cannot be verified without dimensions. The absence of clearance callouts or detail references prevents confirmation that the minimum 5-foot clearance required by UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 is maintained.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4","UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["five transformer pad locations shown on Electrical Plan"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pads shown on Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) in proximity to buildings but clearance dimensions not provided. Minimum 5-foot clearance from buildings cannot be verified from submitted plans."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.2","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Retaining walls are shown on the Grading Plan (Sheet 11) and Site Plan (Sheet 9) in two primary locations: southeast corner near Building 4 and around the detention pond in the northeast.","reasoning":"Transformer pads are not located immediately adjacent to any of the identified retaining walls based on the electrical plan layout. The closest pad (east of Building 4) is near an existing stone retaining wall, but visual inspection suggests adequate separation. Since retaining walls are present, this item is applicable but cannot be verified without dimensions.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["retaining wall areas on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Retaining walls are present on site, but no clearance dimensions are shown between transformer pads and retaining walls. This item is not verifiable from available plans but may not apply to specific pad locations."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.3","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows wooden privacy fences are planned around the property perimeter (marked with H.6 hatch pattern on Landscape Plan), but these are property boundary fences, not adjacent to specific transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"The site plan shows fencing along perimeter but not immediately adjacent to any transformer pad. This item is applicable only where fences are adjacent to pads; the specific configuration shown does not trigger this requirement for the identified pads.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["perimeter fence areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fences are proposed on site perimeter but not immediately adjacent to identified transformer pads. Applicability limited."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows all identified transformer pads at standard 5-foot minimum clearance configuration (not reduced 3-foot clearance). No notation or plan callout indicates reduced clearance exception.","reasoning":"This item applies only when clearances less than 5 feet to buildings are shown with claims of reduced clearance under the exception. Since no such reduced clearance is indicated, this item does not apply.","tools_used":[]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Reduced clearance exception (3 feet to brick/masonry) not claimed on plans. Item not applicable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan shows single-story townhome buildings with no balconies or cantilevered overhangs visible above transformer pad locations.","reasoning":"The architectural configuration shown on the site plan does not indicate balconies or roof overhangs extending above the transformer pad areas. This item applies only where such features are present adjacent to pads.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No balconies or building overhangs shown above transformer pads. Item not applicable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.6","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Transformer equipment is shown on electrical plan but no designation of oil-filled vs. dry-type is provided. Building elevation drawings are not included in the submitted site plan set to show window/door locations relative to transformer pads.","reasoning":"This requirement applies specifically to oil-filled equipment and requires verification of window/door/duct proximity and grade elevation. Without equipment specifications and building elevation details, compliance cannot be verified.","tools_used":[]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["buildings adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer equipment specifications (oil-filled vs. dry-type) and building elevations showing window/door locations not provided. 12-foot clearance requirement from windows/doors cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Concrete sidewalks are shown on site plan adjacent to buildings and circulation areas. One transformer pad (south of Building 8) is shown near sidewalk/circulation areas, but no dimension is provided.","reasoning":"Minimum 2-foot clearance from back of sidewalks is required but distances are not dimensioned on plans. Sidewalks are present but clearance cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["sidewalk areas adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sidewalks are present on site plan but no clearance dimensions are shown between transformer pads and back of sidewalks. Compliance not verifiable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.8","status":"n/a","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan (Sheet 9) and fire protection plan (Sheet 10) show no stairwells or enclosed stairs adjacent to transformer pad locations identified on electrical plan.","reasoning":"No stairwells are shown adjacent to any transformer pads. Item applies only where stairwells are present near pads.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No stairwells shown adjacent to transformer pads. Item not applicable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire protection plan (Sheet 10) shows one private fire hydrant located near the transformer pad east of Building 7 (approximately where the vision tool identified 'FH' symbol). However, no dimension is provided showing the distance between the hydrant and transformer pad.","reasoning":"Fire hydrant location is marked on the plan, and it appears to be in close proximity to a transformer pad. Without equipment designation (oil-filled vs. dry) and without clearan