able 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No niche service configuration proposed. All pads are external. Item not applicable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.12","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"One fire hydrant (FH) is shown on Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) southeast of Building 7, in proximity to a transformer pad location. No dimension is provided showing the distance between the hydrant and the pad.","reasoning":"Fire hydrant is present on site and appears adjacent to a transformer pad, but exact clearance is not dimensioned. Minimum 5-foot clearance cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["fire hydrant location southeast of Building 7"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire hydrant shown on plan in proximity to transformer pad but clearance dimension not provided. Minimum 5-foot clearance not verifiable."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.13","status":"not-verifiable","agentTrace":{"observation":"Trees are visible on electrical plan (Sheet 21) immediately adjacent to all five transformer pad locations. The landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows trees but does not include specific species identification for trees near transformer pads. Tree list (Sheet 32) provides surveyed trees but does not reference utility-compatible (UC) designation per ECM Appendix F for trees near pads.","reasoning":"Trees are clearly present in proximity to all transformer pads, but specific species and utility-compatibility status cannot be verified from submitted documents. ECM Appendix F UC designation cross-reference is not provided.","tools_used":["vision"]},"codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4","ECM Appendix F"],"applicableAreas":["all five transformer pad locations surrounded by tree canopy"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21