e plan detail prevents verification regardless.\n\n**PASS ITEMS:**\n- EL-2.2: No transmission lines (N/A)\n- EL-2.4: No transmission lines (N/A)\n- EL-2.5: No transmission easement (N/A)\n- EL-2.10: Species are identified with common and scientific names (PASS)","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0303f2e2-ff0c-4b14-bd62-f1e72863d84c","uuid":"236211b4-db4e-40d9-ac14-db8d4d559a99"}
