the owner of Lot A, Trico Subdivision... do hereby adopt this map or plat as my subdivision of said tract to be known and designated as MECEY SUBDIVISION and I do hereby dedicate to the public all streets and easements as shown hereon.\"*\n*   **City Code Compliance:**\n    Located in the bottom right, it reads: *\"C8c - 75 - 160 This is to certify that Austin City Code Chapter 23.27 of 1954 has been complied with. Surveyed Aug. 20, 1975\"* signed by Forrest B. Scott, Reg. Public Surveyor #399.\n*   **Filing Record:**\n    The plat is filed in the Travis County records. The text on the left side confirms it was filed on the *\"11 day of Dec. A.D. 1975\"* and recorded *\"in the Plat Records of said County in Book 73, Page 76\"*.\n*   **Adjoining Properties Identified:**\n    *   North: \"CORTEZ HEIGHTS - PLAT BK. 64 PG. 13\", \"F.D. BADGER\"\n    *   South: \"O.R. ROGERS\"\n    *   East: \"CLAWSON DRIVE\"\n    *   West: \"VALLEY VIEW ROAD\", \"Doris Shropshire\""}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bba534d5-0ed6-41d8-bc2c-fb63a7697ee2","uuid":"49dbce8b-9857-456a-8480-8a6f1ef99f40","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided plat map (Sheet 2, MECEY SUBDIVISION), here is the information requested:\n\n### 1. Property boundaries and lot lines\n**Boundary of Lot 1:**\nProperty lines are clearly delineated using solid lines for outer boundaries and a dashed line separating Lot 1 from Lot 2. However, distinct linear distance measurements exclusively for the top and bottom boundaries of *just* Lot 1 are not explicitly provided; the measurements shown span the entirety of the subdivision (Lot 1 + Lot 2).\n\n*   **Northern Boundary:** Bounded by a solid line with an overall bearing of \"**S 61° 14' E**\" and an overall distance of \"**419.67'**\" (which spans both lots). A dimension of \"**374.00'**\" is also noted above this line, near the western end.\n*   **Southern Boundary:** Bounded by a solid line with an overa