{"level":30,"time":1778246510978,"pid":122,"hostname":"bd047d16-36d","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR3W0NYDD7TFDP2H75W53KEY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! I have successfully created comprehensive findings for all 47 checklist items in the EL-1 grouping. The findings include:\n\n- **7 FAIL items** - items where requirements are clearly not met\n- **24 NOT-VERIFIABLE items** - items where documentation is absent or insufficient\n- **15 N/A items** - items where the requirement doesn't apply to this project\n- **1 PASS item** - EL-1.46 (48-hour notification requirement)\n\nThe major deficiencies are:\n1. No building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor elevations\n2. No section/profile views showing vertical clearances\n3. No clearance dimensions shown on any plan sheets\n4. Features (driveway, retaining walls, trees) shown directly over/crossing OHE lines without clearance documentation\n5. Trees not verified as utility-compatible per ECM Appendix F\n6. No registered surveyor mid-span clearance survey data\n7. Lack of utility pole location markings despite overhead facilities being present\n\nThe 48-hour notification requirement is satisfied (PASS).\n\nThe output has been successfully submitted with all required agentTrace data, code citations, applicable areas, sheet references, and clear comments for each item.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"537eedd0-5217-4f75-802b-fac17558245e","uuid":"4b2f39e5-ae02-40ed-9105-301f66db3816"}
