cklist item. For applicability, I need to determine if each item applies to this project. The site clearly has:\n- Overhead electric distribution facilities on and adjacent to site\n- Proposed buildings, driveways, retaining walls, fences (potentially), and landscaping\n\n\n- Multiple points where proposed work intersects or runs near existing OHE\n\nI'll work through the checklist systematically, assessing each item against what's shown and what's missing from the plans.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e942253-7258-4c80-b1f5-d3905a77aa10","uuid":"4e4c9f9c-c66b-4244-95f7-39fe4debcfef"}
